2	//!
3	//! Builds a polygon out of `n` overlapping axis-aligned squares, hands it to
4	//! the earcut triangulator and prints the resulting vertex indices separated
5	//! by spaces.
6	//!
7	//! Build standalone with `rustc -O test4.rs` (the modules below are pulled in
8	//! by path), or via `cargo build --release`, which builds the same file as the
9	//! `test4` binary target alongside the `earcut_test4` library.
